{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you are using TanStack Devtools in a Solid application, we recommend using the Solid Adapter. The Solid Adapter provides a set of easy-to-use hooks on top of the core Devtools utilities. If you find yourself wanting to use the core Devtools classes/functions directly, the Solid Adapter will also re-export everything from the core package."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/solid-devtools","lang":"sh"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"solid-hooks","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid Hooks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TODO"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"solid-hooks","text":"Solid Hooks","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nIf you are using TanStack Devtools in a Solid application, we recommend using the Solid Adapter. The Solid Adapter provides a set of easy-to-use hooks on top of the core Devtools utilities. If you find yourself wanting to use the core Devtools classes/functions directly, the Solid Adapter will also re-export everything from the core package.\n\n## Installation\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/solid-devtools\n```\n\n## Solid Hooks\n\nTODO\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: TanStack Devtools Solid Adapter\nid: adapter\n---\n\nIf you are using TanStack Devtools in a Solid application, we recommend using the Solid Adapter. The Solid Adapter provides a set of easy-to-use hooks on top of the core Devtools utilities. If you find yourself wanting to use the core Devtools classes/functions directly, the Solid Adapter will also re-export everything from the core package.\n\n## Installation\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/solid-devtools\n```\n\n## Solid Hooks\n\nTODO\n"}
